{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1394574-vampire-the-masquerade-v5-session-write-ups-and-chronicle-links","id":1394574,"title":"Vampire the Masquerade V5 - Session Write-ups and Chronicle Links","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-06T09:31:52-07:00","id":1394574,"title":"Vampire the Masquerade V5 - Session Write-ups and Chronicle Links","content":"A few people have messaged me saying that it's difficult to keep track of the stories I post due to the way forums push things off the bottom. In light of that, here's a link to a compilation page with links to all the sessions so far, in chronological order.<br /> <br /> Each also has a spoiler free description of the contents of each session. Faction profiles created for the players are also included though they are also linked to in the actual write-ups when they might be informative.<br /> <br /> I'm open to feedback and constructive criticism as well if any of you have some spare time...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/p/infiltrate-la-chronicle-welcome-to-l.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/p/infiltrate-la-chronicle-welcome-to-l.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/p/infiltrate-la-chronicle-welcome-to-l.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/p/infiltrate-la-chronicle-welcome-to-l.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-13T09:17:22-07:00","id":1396183,"title":"","content":"Here's the next part. The link in the first post has also been updated to include links to the new content.<br /> <br /> &quot;The coterie offers Mariel St. John a solution to her San Fernando problem and Michael attempts to push Gloria Martinez into a more aggressive stance against Jesus Ramirez in order to break his hold over El Hermandad.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_13.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_13.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_13.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_13.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T09:24:54-07:00","id":1397753,"title":"","content":"Part Five of the 'Inevitable Betrayals' Story.<br /> <br /> &quot;The coteries manipulations have bought three baronies to the brink of war with one another, and set two others on courses that could result in their decimation. All that remains is to ensure that the trail of blame leads to a target other than themselves. Fortunately they have a candidate in mind...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_20.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_20.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_20.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_20.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-06T09:01:04-07:00","id":1401353,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">A solo session...<br /> <br /> &quot;Marius 'The Fixer' Walker has contacted Dr Daniel Matthews to ask him to remove a troublesome Brujah visitor to the city. However their destruction must be made to look like an unfortunate accident of circumstance...&quot;</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-27T10:07:09-07:00","id":1404936,"title":"","content":"A kindred recon team from San Francisco are scouting the mountains to the North of Los Angeles and Marius would very much like them to fail in that mission. Unfortunately Prince Vannevar knows Marius's methods so another solution is needed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session_27.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session_27.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session_27.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session_27.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T09:33:13-07:00","id":1408369,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Nosferatu elder, Alonzo believes he has discovered the secret to Jeremy MacNeils power over the other barons and the ease with which the Masquerade was maintained while he was the defacto baron of Los Angeles. The coterie have been contacted to assist their ally with verifying this theory...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty-six.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty-six.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty-six.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty-six.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T09:14:35-07:00","id":1409576,"title":"","content":"The Nosferatu information broker, Gary Golden's price for the information the coterie requires is the destruction of the ghouls, blood bound mortals and dregs left behind by the Mistress of the Swarm. They are currently infesting the warrens below Hollywood and need eliminating before they become a permanent fixture.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-28T09:41:00-07:00","id":1410856,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie has received the information they earned from Gary Golden and are ready to begin investigating the former Havens of Jeremy MacNeil for clues to the system with which he monitored and controlled L.A..&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/08/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty_28.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...-sixty_28.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-04T08:42:50-07:00","id":1411803,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie discover they have two new groups of rivals who are also in search of Jeremy MacNeils secrets. Unfortunately, at least one of these seems to now somehow be ahead of them.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-sixty.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ion-sixty.html</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T09:07:18-07:00","id":1413037,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie's understanding with the MacNeils is short-lived and results in the issuing of an invitation that they cannot refuse. At least not without consequences...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...n-seventy.html</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fWQ77v4LtkE/X1qbPGSXRhI/AAAAAAABVeU/Xptsyi-Z-AQgqjq5SqzcZUssoXuPr_hswCLcBGAsYHQ/s899/Sacrifical%2BBlade%2B-%2BKris.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T09:56:22-07:00","id":1414416,"title":"","content":"&quot;The stakes are raised as a competitor is eliminated and the involvement of a mysterious new potential ally greatly concerns Michael, but for reasons he cannot reveal to his allies. It also seems apparent that they have once again crossed paths with the sinister megacorporation known as Pentex.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eventy_18.html</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-0KtgpxsAeOg/X2HvYFk9hWI/AAAAAAABVls/OdrpaRjB1L451_Ir7POcey1FgwY8TGW3gCLcBGAsYHQ/s788/LogoPentex.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-25T09:20:19-07:00","id":1415426,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie attempt to recruit the elusive Gangrel guide known simply as 'Crow' for their upcoming mission into suspected Werewolf territory. They are also called to task by Baron Isaac Abrams for Daniel's continual trespass's into his domain without the courtesy of asking permission first.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eventy_25.html</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9SQ4mDRnPsg/X2aEvICohNI/AAAAAAABVpE/5Z9mFPyYE3oZBEet0G0oWMxHpq3nvzv1QCLcBGAsYHQ/s600/%2527Crow%2527%2B-%2BGreek%2BGangrel%2B-%2BIndependent%2BAnarch%2B.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T09:13:12-07:00","id":1416483,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie receives a warning from Carmelita that their enquiries into Isaac Abrams have attracted the attention of the Toreador Justicar. In better news they also discover that Velvet Velour has surprising levels of influence with a number of Barons and that she has been using it on their behalf.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;However much more alarmingly, they find themselves in need of a crash course in dealing with werewolves...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...n-seventy.html</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-G4kXyH1jBs4/X2vTWyS8teI/AAAAAAABVxQ/ZmC8UdcZuucMwECRqIKzXkxHUCUl7v95wCLcBGAsYHQ/s620/Werewolves%2B5%2Bforms%2B-%2BSize%2BComparison.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-09T09:15:38-07:00","id":1417464,"title":"","content":"&quot;The location of MacNeil's System is finally in their hands. They have a guide, all their painstakingly gathered clues and a small armoury of weapons. Now they merely have to get in and out of Griffith Park while avoiding a tribe of werewolves known as the Black Spiral Dancers.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What could possibly go wrong?&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...seventy_9.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T09:26:11-07:00","id":1418537,"title":"","content":"&quot;Before the coterie gets a chance to enjoy the long sought after computer system with which Jeremy MacNeil kept tabs on Los Angeles, they are interrupted by a pack of Werewolves. These Bone Gnawers are hunting a pack of enemies from a tribe known as the Black Spiral Dancers. It seems that a reckoning between the werewolf tribes is about to occur...and the coterie is right in the middle of it's ground zero...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_16.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eventy_16.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T03:02:45-07:00","id":1419953,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Kindred baronies begin to gradually re-establish their activities after lying low during the werewolf civil war. Many have realised that this is an ideal time to get ahead of any rivals who may be slower to react, some more aggressively than others...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T10:18:32-07:00","id":1421000,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie has decided that since they currently lack the resources to get ahead of their revivals they are instead going to sabotage the progress of those who are currently the biggest threats. Their starting point is therefore Victor Girard, the power behind El Hermandad's Baron, Gloria Martinez.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session_30.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session_30.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session_30.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session_30.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-06T09:12:18-08:00","id":1422255,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael is making a last ditch attempt to stop a war between two alliances of Baronies breaking out in the centre of Los Angeles. In a possibly dangerous move he has decided to meet directly with the kindred leaders involved...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-20T07:34:22-08:00","id":1425159,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie is now fully focussed on undermining Victor Girard, Media Magnate and would be power behind the Barons of Los Angeles. However to do this they need allies and Michael has learned of a vampiric artefact that would gain them considerable favour with the Baron of Hollywood, Isaac Abrams.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MljVc6xLAws/X49jeatNtmI/AAAAAAABWfA/aWuEgnJBRs0f5lFuwdmRPIm50iuLE4RWQCLcBGAsYHQ/s237/Martinelli%2527s_Ring%2B-%2BVampiric%2BArtefact.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-27T09:53:12-08:00","id":1426330,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie begins to doubt the intentions behind several apparently benevolent schemes of Victor's and share their suspicions with Marius. Meanwhile, 'Max', one of the North East's newest residents has an unfortunate encounter with some trespassers. Unfortunate for the trespassers that is...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_27.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_27.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_27.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_27.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-04T08:39:55-08:00","id":1427278,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie attempt the risky strategy of turning Baron Gloria Martinez of El Hermandad and Baron Allison Maller of Anaheim against their advisor Victor Girard. Neither of the two childer of Salvador Garcia are particularly easy to convince however...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-12T06:00:09-08:00","id":1428175,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coteries scheme to undermine their rival Victor Girard requires them to broaden the scope of their plan considerably. Old favours are called in and new allies are asked for boons which will be repaid with the bloody fruits of their successes...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_11.htm\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...seventy_11.htm</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-20T02:25:26-08:00","id":1429125,"title":"","content":"&quot;The plan to weaken Victor's power base by crippling his media empire requires Daniel to engage in a number of clandestine operations that his Baron can plausibly deny knowledge of...in the event that he fails...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2020/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-seventy_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eventy_18.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-09T03:02:15-08:00","id":1431551,"title":"","content":"&quot;With Victor's media empire destroyed and his influence crippled, the coterie must deal with the resulting civil war within El Hermandad and the retaliations of an enemy now aware of exactly of who is to blame for his current misfortunes...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...on-eighty.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-16T05:14:32-08:00","id":1432398,"title":"","content":"&quot;The disruptions to the Anarch Free States created by the destruction of Victor and his allies has consequences of it's own as the balance of power within the city changes once more.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eighty_15.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T10:59:07-08:00","id":1438338,"title":"","content":"&quot;As the Free States re-establish themselves with one less manipulative force in play, the coterie uses the chaos and uncertainty to pursue their own schemes and powerplays.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_22.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eighty_22.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T09:05:11-07:00","id":1440605,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie locates a kindred in search of their lost childe. A childe apparently taken by the Unbound ghouls known as The Young Bloods...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...on-eighty.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-30T09:50:57-07:00","id":1446618,"title":"","content":"&quot;Vannevar's forces have taken San Jose from the Anarchs and the few survivors of the attack now seek refuge in Los Angeles. Meanwhile the Unbound ghouls of The Young Bloods have taken advantage of the confusion to further their own goals...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...eighty_19.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T09:04:54-07:00","id":1449989,"title":"","content":"Michael attempts to use the situation in San Jose to further his plan to form a council of Anarch Barons, a council that hopefully someone with appropriate skills can guide in the right direction...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...on-eighty.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T08:57:53-07:00","id":1451672,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael's plan to use the invasion of San Jose by the Camarilla Prince of San Francisco to form an Anarch Council has began. Gloria Martinez and Allison Maller have already agreed to join such a council though they have some conditions of their own...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/...on-eighty.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T07:53:12-07:00","id":1458833,"title":"","content":"&quot;The concept of an Anarch War Council has gone from mere theory to fact and now thirteen of the most powerful kindred in the city are converging on Downtown to discuss how to eliminate the Camarilla from Los Angeles. Ironically the location for the meeting is Venture Tower, once the haven of the last Prince to attempt to hold sway over the city...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_28.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_28.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_28.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty_28.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T10:00:45-07:00","id":1463108,"title":"","content":"&quot;With several Baronies without leadership and others severely weakened, the Anarch Council has some difficult decisions to make before it can stage a counter-attack against the Camarilla forces threatening the Anarch Free States.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/06/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T09:24:21-07:00","id":1464752,"title":"","content":"&quot;The loyalty of the none Anarch factions within the city is called to question as discussion of the Camarilla invasion of Los Angeles continues. In addition, Prince Vannevar Thomas's method of infiltrating the city so completely may have been discovered...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/07/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-eighty.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-30T10:59:24-07:00","id":1465925,"title":"","content":"&quot;Daniel has tasked his two ghouls with scouting out the construction site currently being used by the Camarilla to infiltrate the Anarch Free States. Though they have the advantage of being able to operate during the day, the mission is still a dangerous one.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/09/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T10:15:46-07:00","id":1466785,"title":"","content":"The Anarch Council have agreed to gather the best covert operatives from a number of different Baronies. Their goal is the infiltration and investigation of one of the suspected staging points for the Camarilla's imminent invasion from within of the Anarch Free States of Los Angeles.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T11:14:54-08:00","id":1467697,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael enters the Nosferatu Warrens below Hollywood to awaken The Crypts Sons Baron from torpor. Meanwhile an idea is put forward to bring order to an increasingly fractured Anarch Council though not all the Barons are happy with the suggested solution...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01174036980.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01174036980.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01174036980.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01174036980.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-02T11:17:55-08:00","id":1471679,"title":"","content":"&quot;With The Unbound Ghoul gang 'The Young Bloods' attacking Baronies on Vannevar's behalf and all connections to his involvement being systematically eliminated, it is clear that the assault upon the Anarch Free States is imminent.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Anarchs are busy implementing a bold plan to pre-empt this insidious attack. It involves a high profile assassination and one hell of an explosion...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/10/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01501755347.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...501755347.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-03T10:47:25-08:00","id":1471744,"title":"","content":"Hope and Vin head to Peter Kwan's base of operations with the intention of bringing his unlife to an abrupt end as a message to his sire Jochen Van Nuys, leader of the Camarilla's operations against the Anarch Free States. Unfortunately they aren't the only kindred interested in Peter's activities...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/...on-ninety.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-04T14:56:52-08:00","id":1471801,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's time for the Anarchs to strike an explosive blow against the leader of the Camarilla enemies who have infiltrated their domain...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ninety_12.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-22T10:18:44-08:00","id":1473033,"title":"","content":"The Anarch Free States have once more been plunged into chaos. Masquerade breaches are becoming more and more likely as incidents of violence between kindred occur citywide between the Anarchs and the Camarilla invaders.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ninety_12.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-18T09:57:51-08:00","id":1474909,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Anarch Free States have once more been plunged into chaos. Masquerade breaches are becoming more and more likely as incidents of violence between kindred occur citywide between the Anarchs and the Camarilla invaders. Fortunately for the coterie, they have recently acquired a tool to assist their fellow Baronies, as long as their allies are willing to pay the price that is...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/...e-session.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-11T09:10:49-08:00","id":1476212,"title":"","content":"&quot;Two individuals awake to find themselves buried in a clearing in the mountains. With no knowledge of who they are, how they got there or what their captors have in store for them they have no choice but to try and survive long enough to discover what they have become...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/11/vampire-masquerade-v5-interlude-session_0421015836.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...421015836.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-18T10:20:26-07:00","id":1476669,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&quot;Baron Tomassio and his coterie have been authorised by the Anarch Council to meet with the Camarilla Negotiator, Kelvin Wee. Their goal is to arrange a summit between the leaders within San Francisco and those of Los Angeles in order to end their mutual hostilities before the Sabbat can take advantage of two cities weakened by war.&quot;</span></span></div><br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2021/12/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...on-ninety.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-01T09:06:58-07:00","id":1477857,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&quot;The failed attack upon the coterie by The Young Bloods unbound Ghoul gang left a single survivor. Daniel has been tasked with obtaining as much information from them as possible, by whatever means necessary. Meanwhile, rumours of two potential new disruptions to the Anarch Free States have come to the coteries attention.&quot;</span></span></div><br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-ninety_01659458804.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...659458804.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-14T09:22:37-07:00","id":1478850,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie has extracted information from their Young Bloods prisoner that paints a clearer picture of the resources available to this gang of Unbound Ghouls. Hopefully this will help with their upcoming negotiations with The Circulatory System who also wish an end to the Young Bloods activities.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ssion-one.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-21T10:29:52-07:00","id":1479248,"title":"","content":"&quot;A summit is needed to prevent Priss, Baron of The Border and Hank Boyd, Baron of The Crypts Sons going to war. As the Baron of Downtown is the driving force behind Priss's ambitions it is he, not her that the coterie needs to convince of the benefits of a diplomatic solution.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Unfortunately, other elements would very much like the meeting to fail...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0164319362.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0164319362.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0164319362.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/01/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0164319362.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-23T09:54:34-07:00","id":1479344,"title":"","content":"&quot;With the destruction of the traitorous Crypts Son, Kayne Lowe, and his Sabbat allies, the Barons and their followers move to the relative safety of Downtown in order to complete their negotiations. The hidden past of The Crypts Sons and their founder is revealed...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-24T09:33:47-07:00","id":1479427,"title":"","content":"&quot;With Vin and Mr Hertz assisting Hank with the rebuilding of The Crypts Sons, the coterie is sure that their progress can be guided in the right direction. Meanwhile, Michael is searching for a replacement for Daniel during his, hopefully temporary, absence.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_11.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_11.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_11.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_11.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-26T10:40:48-07:00","id":1479553,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie are preparing for a visit to Los Angeles by their sponsor, the Camarilla power broker, Fiorenza Savona. Not only must they conceal this from the Anarch Barons, but also from the Sabbat who have made their presence known within the city and for whom Fiorenza would be a grand prize indeed...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01717212988.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01717212988.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01717212988.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01717212988.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-28T14:09:23-07:00","id":1479669,"title":"","content":"&quot;While contemplating Fiorenza Savona's offer of a sanctioned Diablerie, Michael receives an invitation to the mansion of Baron Louis Fortier to discuss a mutual threat.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_25.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_25.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_25.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/02/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_25.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-03T10:28:40-07:00","id":1480045,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael finally makes a decision on the sanctioned diablerie offered by Fiorenza Savona...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T09:40:52-07:00","id":1480294,"title":"","content":"&quot;While two coterie members prepare for a mission against the Unbound Ghouls who call themselves The Young Bloods, the threat of the Sabbat also rears it's head. But as the Sabbat hunt the Anarchs of Los Angeles, the Anarch Barons have their own plans for removing this threat. Unfortunately for all concerned, Los Angeles has a predator with it's own agenda...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01577129864.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...577129864.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-28T08:10:22-07:00","id":1482157,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael has despatched a team to finally end the Young Bloods threat. Vin and Hope are the offensive part of the mission, but in the absence of Daniel, the support aspects are under the control of the Nosferatu Hacker, Eric. Meanwhile, other elements with their own agendas threaten to complicate matters.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0349803765.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...349803765.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-03T08:32:39-07:00","id":1482934,"title":"","content":"&quot;After fighting their way through the mortal 'Prospects' of the Young Bloods gang, the team must now face those full-blooded gang members enhanced by the vitae of their kindred prisoners.&quot;<br /> &quot;Back in Pasadena, Michael has received a visitor with news of a third party who may be about to attempt to take the spoils of his agents work for themselves...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/03/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_0916328405.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...916328405.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T09:16:44-07:00","id":1483609,"title":"","content":"&quot;With Eric's technical support, Hope and Vin have penetrated deep into the base of the Young Bloods where they have discovered the cells of the gangs kindred prisoners. Now they must face the gangs leaders and their unexpected new allies.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Back at Hallowbrook, Daniel is introduced to an unusual kindred who may be able to help with his quest for redemption...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ssion-one.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-07T10:52:51-07:00","id":1494536,"title":"","content":"&quot;The coterie now has nearly a dozen kindred to get back to their rightful havens and homes. Unfortunately the Circulatory System is not yet ready to completely surrender their claim to two of the most important former Young Bloods prisoners.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01971571478.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...971571478.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-08T10:13:33-07:00","id":1494611,"title":"","content":"&quot;The former prisoners of the now defeated unbound ghoul gang are being restored to their homes, while Eric and Zipper wade through the information that they have retrieved from their bunker. 'Romulus', first of the gangs victims, and the one whose fate inspired the rescue, is also finally being taken home to his sire...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_02089146298.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...089146298.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T11:42:30-07:00","id":1494688,"title":"","content":"&quot;Michael has arranged a meeting of the Anarch Council at the behest of the Baron of Downtown. Marius apparently has plans to restore the disbanded Barony of the Angels, but what reason could the notoriously pragmatic Baron have for implementing such a radical change to his own domain?&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...o-session.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T11:22:15-08:00","id":1501548,"title":"","content":"&quot;A kindred of the Salubri Clan has offered to assist in Daniel's quest to restore his humanity. Her price is a tome, hidden below a supposedly abandoned temple, deep within the Santa Monica Mountains...an area protected by a werewolf tribe known as the Black Furies...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/04/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ession_29.html</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24766,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","user":"GMort","date":". 02-17-2023, 12:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-17T09:23:43-08:00","id":1503321,"title":"","content":"&quot;Marius's creation of a reimagined Barony of the Angels has fundamentally changed the Free States in a number of expected and unexpected ways. Meanwhile, Daniel is beginning to consider re-joining the coterie as he has learned that forces both inside and outside L.A. have their own ideas about who should control the city...&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2...ssion-one.html</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-18T03:52:14-08:00","id":1503367,"title":"","content":"The coterie is scouring the city for information on the mysterious new threat to the city that seems to be lurking behind every new rumour they hear...<br /> <br /> Michael has made excuses to see some of his more consistently useful sources of information, Vin is meeting up with Toreador Madame's known as 'The Blossoms' and Daniel has approached Marius's predatory grandechilde Meredith who recently returned from a successful infiltration of The Sabbat...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01919772465.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01919772465.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01919772465.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-session-one_01919772465.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-25T08:41:41-08:00","id":1503892,"title":"","content":"&quot;Daniel is offered a chance to learn exactly what Marius's plan to deal with the Sabbat is. Unfortunately there's a catch. Specifically, he has to accompany 'The Fixer' on his next reconnaissance and get his answers first hand...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gmortschaotica.blogspot.com/2022/05/vampire-masquerade-v5-solo-session.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24766-gmort","name":"GMort","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24766_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-22T08:45:10-07:00","id":1509283,"title":"","content":"&quot;Eric Moore, Nosferatu Hacker, has been contacted by his Mawla Ambrus Maropis to facilitate a communication between Camarilla archivist Carmelita Neillson and Eric's current employer, Baron Michael Tomassio.&quot;<br /> &quot;Meanwhile the Sabbat are seemingly planning to take revenge for their recent losses...&q